title: >-
  IgAN Gd-IgA1 axis — reproducible analysis pipeline for
  "Cell-type-specific genetic and epigenetic control of the galactose-deficient
  IgA1 axis in IgA nephropathy: a multi-omics causal-inference framework with
  East Asian perspectives"

type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-29"
license: MIT

authors:
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Yan
    affiliation: >-
      Department of Nephrology, Affiliated Hospital of Gansu Medical College,
      Pingliang 744000, Gansu, China
    # 【待回填】ORCID（Zenodo 元数据建议填，两处须一致）：
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Juanjuan
    affiliation: >-
      Department of Nephrology, Affiliated Hospital of Gansu Medical College,
      Pingliang 744000, Gansu, China
    # 【待回填】ORCID：
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"

abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis pipeline for a multi-omics causal-inference study of the
  galactose-deficient IgA1 (Gd-IgA1) axis in IgA nephropathy. The package contains
  the analysis scripts for all evidence layers (GEO differential expression,
  cis-eQTL lookup, colocalisation, methylation-mediated causal inference,
  single-cell atlas and upstream-regulator inference, East Asian allele-frequency
  stratification, and druggability scoring), the figure-rendering scripts, and the
  processed result tables underlying the manuscript. Third-party source data
  (GEO, eQTL Catalogue, ImmuNexUT, GWAS Catalog, GoDMC, gnomAD, Pharos, CollecTRI,
  JASPAR) are not redistributed; download/query scripts and accessions are provided
  instead, and the original licences of those resources continue to apply.

keywords:
  - IgA nephropathy
  - galactose-deficient IgA1
  - C1GALT1
  - C1GALT1C1
  - colocalisation
  - single-cell eQTL
  - East Asian

